#. Crowdin string 164162
msgctxt "Groups|Enter a path for your group."
msgid "Groups|Enter a path for your group."
msgstr "Ange en sökväg för gruppen."

#. Crowdin string 114879
msgctxt "Groups|Group README"
msgid "Groups|Group README"
msgstr "README för grupp"

#. Crowdin string 58428
msgctxt "Groups|Group URL"
msgid "Groups|Group URL"
msgstr "Grupp-URL"

#. Crowdin string 493966
msgctxt "Groups|Group name is required."
msgid "Groups|Group name is required."
msgstr "Gruppnamn krävs."

#. Crowdin string 58436
msgctxt "Groups|Group path is available."
msgid "Groups|Group path is available."
msgstr "Gruppsökvägen är tillgänglig."

#. Crowdin string 58438
msgctxt "Groups|Group path is unavailable. Path has been replaced with a suggested available path."
msgid "Groups|Group path is unavailable. Path has been replaced with a suggested available path."
msgstr "Gruppsökvägen är inte tillgänglig. Sökvägen har ersatts med en föreslagen tillgänglig sökväg."

#. Crowdin string 114881
msgctxt "Groups|There was an error creating the Group README."
msgid "Groups|There was an error creating the Group README."
msgstr "Ett fel uppstod när README för gruppen skapades."

#. Crowdin string 423403
msgctxt "Groups|This action permanently deletes this group and all its data. Your administrator cannot restore it. %{linkStart}View data export options.%{linkEnd}"
msgid "Groups|This action permanently deletes this group and all its data. Your administrator cannot restore it. %{linkStart}View data export options.%{linkEnd}"
msgstr "Den här åtgärden tar permanent bort gruppen och alla dess data. Administratören kan inte återställa den. %{linkStart}Visa alternativ för dataexport.%{linkEnd}"

#. Crowdin string 422201
msgctxt "Groups|This action will place this group, including its subgroups and projects, in a pending deletion state for %{delayedDeletionPeriodInDays} days, and delete it permanently on %{date}."
msgid "Groups|This action will place this group, including its subgroups and projects, in a pending deletion state for %{delayedDeletionPeriodInDays} days, and delete it permanently on %{date}."
msgstr "Den här åtgärden försätter denna grupp, med dess undergrupper och projekt, i väntande borttagning i %{delayedDeletionPeriodInDays} dagar och tar sedan bort den permanent den %{date}."

#. Crowdin string 420061
msgctxt "Groups|This process deletes the group, subgroups and project repositories, and all related resources."
msgid "Groups|This process deletes the group, subgroups and project repositories, and all related resources."
msgstr "Den här processen tar bort gruppen, undergrupperna, projektarkiven och alla relaterade resurser."

#. Crowdin string 114883
msgctxt "Groups|This will create a README.md for project %{path}."
msgid "Groups|This will create a README.md for project %{path}."
msgstr "Detta skapar en README.md för projektet %{path}."

#. Crowdin string 114885
msgctxt "Groups|This will create a project %{path} and add a README.md."
msgid "Groups|This will create a project %{path} and add a README.md."
msgstr "Detta skapar projektet %{path} och lägger till en README.md."

#. Crowdin string 420063
msgctxt "Groups|You are about to delete this group containing:"
msgid "Groups|You are about to delete this group containing:"
msgstr "Du håller på att ta bort denna grupp som innehåller:"

#. Crowdin string 162648
msgctxt "Groups|Your group name must not contain a period if you intend to use SCIM integration, as it can lead to errors."
msgid "Groups|Your group name must not contain a period if you intend to use SCIM integration, as it can lead to errors."
msgstr "Gruppnamnet får inte innehålla en punkt om du tänker använda SCIM-integrering, eftersom det kan orsaka fel."

#. Crowdin string 162650
msgctxt "HarborIntegration|The name of the project in the Harbor instance. For example, `testproject`."
msgid "HarborIntegration|The name of the project in the Harbor instance. For example, `testproject`."
msgstr "Namnet på projektet i Harbor-instansen, till exempel `testproject`."

#. Crowdin string 78882
msgctxt "HarborRegistry|There are no harbor images stored for this project"
msgid "HarborRegistry|There are no harbor images stored for this project"
msgstr "Det finns inga Harbor-avbildningar lagrade för detta projekt"

#. Crowdin string 78886
msgctxt "HarborRegistry|With the Harbor Registry, every project can connect to a harbor space to store its Docker images."
msgid "HarborRegistry|With the Harbor Registry, every project can connect to a harbor space to store its Docker images."
msgstr "Med Harbor Registry kan varje projekt ansluta till ett Harbor-utrymme för att lagra sina Docker-avbildningar."

#. Crowdin string 58524
msgctxt "HarborRegistry|With the Harbor Registry, every project can have its own space to store images. %{docLinkStart}More information%{docLinkEnd}"
msgid "HarborRegistry|With the Harbor Registry, every project can have its own space to store images. %{docLinkStart}More information%{docLinkEnd}"
msgstr "Med Harbor Registry kan varje projekt ha ett eget utrymme för att lagra avbildningar. %{docLinkStart}Mer information%{docLinkEnd}"
